      <guid>/ja/en/posts/learning-log-2025-01-21/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-learned-today&#34;&gt;What I Learned Today&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;git-command&#34;&gt;Git Command&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git diff origin/develop &amp;gt; diff.txt&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I learned how to output the difference between the develop branch and the current branch to a file. This is useful for reviews and checking changes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;about-schema&#34;&gt;About Schema&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I deepened my understanding of database schema design. Table structure design is an important foundation for applications.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;todays-achievements&#34;&gt;Today&amp;rsquo;s Achievements&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Understood schema design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Successfully started a new blog&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Selected Hugo as the technology&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Installed a Windows-style AltTab application&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Small steps matter. Let&amp;rsquo;s keep going tomorrow!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-learned-today&#34;&gt;What I Learned Today&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;git-command&#34;&gt;Git Command&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git diff origin/develop &amp;gt; diff.txt&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I learned how to output the difference between the develop branch and the current branch to a file. This is useful for reviews and checking changes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;about-schema&#34;&gt;About Schema&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I deepened my understanding of database schema design. Table structure design is an important foundation for applications.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;todays-achievements&#34;&gt;Today&amp;rsquo;s Achievements&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Understood schema design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Successfully started a new blog&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Selected Hugo as the technology&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;✅ Installed a Windows-style AltTab application&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Small steps matter. Let&amp;rsquo;s keep going tomorrow!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content:encoded>
