t;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I want to accumulate small learnings and connect them to great growth.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content:encoded>
